                        @* Section 1 *@
                        <div class="br-section" id="s1">
                            <h2 class="br-h2">1. What is a Forex VPS?</h2>
                            <p class="br-p">A <strong>VPS (Virtual Private Server)</strong> is a dedicated virtual machine hosted in a professional data centre that runs 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Unlike your home computer, a VPS is always on, always connected to high-speed internet, and always available — regardless of what happens to your local power supply or internet connection.</p>
                            <p class="br-p">For forex traders, a VPS acts as a remote trading workstation. You install MT4 or MT5 on the VPS, connect it to your broker account, load your Expert Advisors, and then disconnect. The VPS continues running your strategies continuously, entering and exiting trades automatically without any need for your home PC to be on.</p>

                            <div class="br-fact-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);margin-bottom:20px;">
