                            <h2 class="br-h2">9. VPS Cost vs Cashback Rebates</h2>
                            <p class="br-p">This is one of the most compelling reasons to combine a forex VPS with a cashback programme. For active EA traders, cashback rebates earned on monthly volume typically cover the VPS cost entirely — making the VPS effectively free infrastructure.</p>

